-- The same correction as 011, for the King James and World English translations.
--
-- These two are affected far less than the Berean, but in the same way. What was
-- absorbed into the preceding verse here is:
--
--   KJV    the traditional epistle subscriptions ("Written from Rome unto the
--          Ephesians by Tychicus."), and the Hebrew letter names in Psalm 119
--   WEB-C  section headings in Daniel, and the Psalm 119 letter names
--
-- The Douay-Rheims is unaffected; its package carries no headings.
--
-- Safe to run more than once: each statement matches the exact damaged text.


-- ---------- King James Version ----------
